# Keep Spec Kit definitions and bug assessments; exclude run/profile snapshots
/.specify/workflows/**
/.specify/bugs/**
!/.specify/bugs/**/
!/.specify/bugs/**/*.md
!/.specify/bugs/**/*.patch
!/.specify/bugs/**/*.diff
!/.specify/bugs/*/*.json
/.specify/bugs/**/Default/
/.specify/bugs/**/GPUPersistentCache/
/.specify/bugs/**/extracted/
/.specify/bugs/**/source/
